  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): an image — a long-exposure X-Pro3 shot MADE WITH torchslit would\n     be the perfect hero once it exists. Draft until then. -->\n<p class=\"\">It's not actually a camera — it's a light-accompaniment: a strobe-light tool that scripts the iPhone's torch, meant to be paired with long-exposure photographs on my X-Pro3. A photographer's tool. It's still in development — I haven't really tried or tested it much yet; I've been fixing bugs with it.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The bulb-capture engine — Metal-accelerated HDR frame accumulation\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/torchslit-ios/code.png\" alt=\"The bulb-capture engine — Metal-accelerated HDR frame accumulation\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/torchslit-ios/code.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/torchslit-ios/code.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/torchslit-ios/code.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/torchslit-ios/code.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The bulb-capture engine — Metal-accelerated HDR frame accumulation\" width=\"1400\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:-1.98deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1400×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The bulb-capture engine — Metal-accelerated HDR frame accumulation</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The SwiftUI camera UI — live preview, recording indicator, and bottom controls\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/torchslit-ios/code2.png\" alt=\"The SwiftUI camera UI — live preview, recording indicator, and bottom controls\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/torchslit-ios/code2.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/torchslit-ios/code2.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/torchslit-ios/code2.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/torchslit-ios/code2.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The SwiftUI camera UI — live preview, recording indicator, and bottom controls\" width=\"1400\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:-0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1400×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The SwiftUI camera UI — live preview, recording indicator, and bottom controls</figcaption>\n</figure>",
